# No migrate commands

Never run database migration commands. The user owns applying migrations.

Do **not** execute any of:

- `make migrate-up`, `make migrate-down`, `make migrate-force`, or other `make migrate-*` targets
- `go run cmd/migrate/main.go ...`
- `migrate up`, `migrate down`, `migrate force`, or any `migrate` CLI invocation

You may still create or edit migration SQL files under `cmd/migrate/migrations/` when asked. Tell the user which migrate command they should run themselves after writing files.
